<http://data.silknow.org/object/f8493d84-b017-393c-b20c-942b26a9abd5/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Dress fabric of brocaded silk damask. Cream damask ground with one yellow pattern weft, and the other colours are brocaded. Tissue with the pattern bound in 3/1/ twill and damask based on a satin of 8. Two repeats in the width of the material. Selvedge is one green satin stripe and 5 cords. Asymmetrical lace pattern with some details brocaded. Colours are deep pink, deep blue, green, tan, salmon and mid blue."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/f8493d84-b017-393c-b20c-942b26a9abd5> .

